5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we're all going, let's ensure the environment suits everyone. I think we need to look at how we've spent our time in previous years to avoid any imbalances.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds lovely, Mizuki. I also think it would be wonderful if we could clarify the costs beforehand, so no one feels burdened by the arrangements.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I agree... I wonder if we can find out about the bathrooms and when we have to eat? I think those things are important for feeling relaxed.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I think we should prioritize the travel logistics. It would be helpful to know exactly how much time we spend moving and waiting.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue. I'd really like to know the total cost for the whole week upfront so we can all plan our budgets without any surprises.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, you're right. The layout of the accommodation often dictates the mood. I'll look into the previous years' schedules to see what worked.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, I'm glad you agree. I'll look into the all-in rates to see if that makes things simpler for everyone's wallet.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,Thank you... I'll check the bathing hours and the room arrangements. I just want to make sure we have a comfortable place to be.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I'll look into the ferry and train schedules. I want to see if we can minimize the time spent in transit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I'll look into the pricing of offshore houses and the all-in rates as well. I want to compare the total costs clearly.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll also check the time spent alone in shared houses. I suspect the balance of privacy and group time is where we usually struggle.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also look into the pricing of offshore houses. It might be a more transparent way to handle the costs for the whole group.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'll also look into the inn mealtimes. I think knowing the schedule helps me feel less nervous about the trip.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'll also check the general train and bus accessibility. I'm hoping we can find a way to get there more efficiently this year.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I think that covers the main points. I'll focus on the all-in rates and the offshore house pricing to get a full picture of the expenses.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
