34,2,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I've found that our feeling of being crowded or alone depends on the setting. A shared house left us with no privacy, while last year's separate plans left us disconnected.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I've looked into the costs. All-in rates are simple, but they might be unfair to some. A whole house is a fixed price, which could be very transparent.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"I found out that the inns have very strict mealtimes and we'd all be in one room. The houses have fewer bathrooms, and the water might get cold.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The travel times are a concern. The ferry option takes up two full days of our week just for moving. The city option is much more efficient.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I've seen that all-in rates can be unfair to some, but they are predictable. The offshore houses have a clear base price, but food is extra.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, if the ferry takes two days, we lose precious group time. But @Minato, the strictness of an inn might make us feel too crowded.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, if we rent a whole house, we can just split the total cost equally. It prevents anyone from paying more just because they are the one organizing.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,I'm a bit worried about the one-room futon arrangement... and the cold water in the houses. I think having a door might be better.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,The city option allows us to arrive and start our holiday immediately. We wouldn't spend the first and last days just waiting for transport.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Shizue. A fixed house price is great, but I'm worried about the ""food on top"" part. That's where the costs usually become unpredictable.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we have a choice between a structured inn, a private house, or a city hotel. We need a balance where we aren't forced together, but aren't drifting apart.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"Perhaps the city hotel is a good middle ground? We can have separate rooms for comfort, and we can decide on meals as we go.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,I like the idea of a door... and not having a fixed time to be at the table. It makes me feel more at ease.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I strongly support the city option. The transit is seamless. We can maximize our actual vacation time instead of spending it in stations and ports.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"If we go with a city hotel, can we agree on a daily budget for meals? I just want to avoid the bill being a surprise at the end.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I think the city hotel solves the privacy issue I found in the house data and the isolation issue from last year, as we'll be in a central hub.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"As long as we are clear about the payment for the rooms and meals, I am very happy with the city hotel. It seems the most considerate choice.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I feel much better about the city hotel. I think I can sleep better if I have my own space and a flexible schedule.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,It's the only option that doesn't waste our time. I'm very much in favor of it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I'm okay with the city hotel, provided we can set a clear cap or a fixed budget for the shared parts of the trip.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
