60,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Option A is too structured, and Option B is too crowded. Option C allows us to be together by choice, which is the healthiest dynamic for us.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B's house price is clear, but the food is a worry. Option C allows us to manage our own costs and ensures everyone's comfort.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,I don't like the idea of everyone in one room in Option A or B. Option C feels the safest and most relaxing for me.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Option B is out for me because of the ferry. Option A is okay, but Option C is the most efficient. I vote for the city.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,Option B is risky because of the extra food costs. Option A's all-in rate is predictable but potentially unfair. Option C is fine if we budget.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, we can simply agree on a daily meal budget for Option C. That gives us the predictability you want and the space we all need.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a wonderful suggestion, Mizuki. A simple agreement on a budget would make Option C very fair for everyone.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,I think I would be very happy with Option C. I can have my own room and I don't have to worry about the bath schedule.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,I'm glad we're leaning this way. The time saved on travel is a huge benefit for me. I'll be much more rested.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,"If we set a budget for the shared meals and the hotel is booked upfront, I'm completely on board with Option C.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we have a consensus. Option C provides the best balance of group cohesion and personal space, while being the most efficient for travel.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. It is the most considerate option for everyone's different needs and ensures no one is quietly paying more than their share.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'm glad we talked about this. I feel much more comfortable now knowing we have a plan that respects everyone's space.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'm satisfied. The efficiency of the city break is the deciding factor for me.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'm happy too. Knowing the hotel cost now and agreeing on a meal budget removes the stress I usually feel during these trips.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
